1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:00,980
Fog.

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:02,500
Today I don't swim.

3
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,799
Where is the big rock?

4
00:00:03,799 --> 00:00:05,200
Every day it's there.

5
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,839
Today, nothing.

6
00:00:06,839 --> 00:00:07,339
If I can't

7
00:00:07,339 --> 00:00:08,118
see the rock,

8
00:00:08,118 --> 00:00:09,539
I don't go in.

9
00:00:09,539 --> 00:00:10,900
Salvatore used to say,

10
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,480
"The fog is the sea

11
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,779
closing the door,

12
00:00:13,779 --> 00:00:14,519
and you don't knock

13
00:00:14,519 --> 00:00:15,339
on a closed door."

14
00:00:16,379 --> 00:00:17,940
You're not the postman.

15
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,620
So today, coffee.

16
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:20,859
The door is closed.

17
00:00:20,859 --> 00:00:22,120
The morning is not.

18
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,460
It's in my book, amore.

19
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,320
You miss one,

20
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,379
you do the next.

21
00:00:25,379 --> 00:00:27,140
Tomorrow, the door opens. Ciao.

